 ("note", "IMPORTANT", "**There is no year zero** — 1 CE follows 1 BCE directly. To find years between a BCE and a CE date, **add them and subtract 1**. 2 BCE to 2 CE = 2 + 2 − 1 = **3** years. Buddha's birth to 2024 CE: 560 + 2024 − 1 = **2,583** years. Between two BCE dates (or two CE dates) simply subtract."),
 ("h3", "Timeline"),
